.TH flightlog-push 1 2026-09-28 "flightlog 0.2.2" "flightlog manual"
.SH NAME
flightlog\-push \- Upload a bundle to a presigned URL (validated first)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBflightlog push\fR [\fB\-\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-url\-file\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Upload a bundle to a presigned URL (validated first)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
Presigned upload URL (HTTP PUT)
.TP
\fB\-\-url\-file\fR \fI<URL_FILE>\fR
Read the signed URL from a private file, or \- for stdin
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
The .flightlog.zip
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR flightlog (1)
